 "remarks": "Experience the pinnacle of sophisticated, carefree living in this stunning luxury condominium at Westport's historic and reimagined landmark, The Mill. Seamlessly combining chic modern aesthetics with resort-style amenities, Unit 311 offers a turnkey lifestyle of comfort and elegance. Step inside to an expansive, light-filled open floor plan featuring soaring floor-to-ceiling windows, pristine light wood floors, and a striking gas linear fireplace. The gourmet kitchen is a culinary masterpiece outfitted with Poliform cabinetry, Sub-Zero, Wolf, and Miele appliances, sleek custom cabinetry, and an open layout perfect for seamless entertaining. The primary suite serves as a private sanctuary complete with a generous dressing area and a spa-inspired en-suite bath boasting heated floors and a glass walk-in shower. The den/2nd bedroom is a flexible space that can accommodate a home office. A private heated garage and a locking storage room add to the ease of living.  White-glove convenience is anchored by a front desk concierge to assist with your day-to-day needs. Residents also enjoy a state-of-the-art health and wellness center/gym, a sparkling pool, hot tub, outdoor grilling patio, common rooftop terrace, guest suite and an elegant residents' great room and cafe. Perfectly situated in-town close to Westport's finest dining, shopping, and scenic surroundings.",
